---
layout: article.njk
title: Anfahrt
permalink: /Anfahrt/
---
{% from 'icons.njk' import icon %}
<address class="address-block">
  <strong>{{ praxis.name }}</strong><br>
  {{ praxis.address.street }}<br>
  {{ praxis.address.city }}
</address>
<p><a class="button button--outline" href="{{ praxis.directions | escape }}">Route in Google Maps planen (extern) {{ icon('external') }}</a></p>

<h2>Mit dem Bus</h2>
<dl class="stop-list">
  {% for stop in praxis.transitStops %}
  <div>
    <dt>{{ icon('bus') }} {{ stop.name | escape }}</dt>
    <dd>{{ 'Linien' if stop.lines | length > 1 else 'Linie' }} {{ stop.lines | join(' und ') }} · {{ stop.walkText | escape }}</dd>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</dl>

<h2>Zugang zur Praxis</h2>
{% if praxis.accessibilityNote %}
<p>{{ praxis.accessibilityNote | escape }}</p>
{% else %}
<p>Bei Fragen zum Zugang rufen Sie uns bitte vor Ihrem Besuch unter <a href="{{ praxis.phone.href }}">{{ praxis.phone.display }}</a> an.</p>
{% endif %}

<h2>Kontakt zur Praxis</h2>
<p>Telefon <a href="{{ praxis.phone.href }}">{{ praxis.phone.display }}</a><br>
  Fax {{ praxis.fax }}<br>
  E-Mail <a href="mailto:{{ praxis.email }}">{{ praxis.email }}</a></p>
